          "settings": {
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/8b4eb90f7b58bf4b08c86644c2732621.png",
            "title": "Remanufactured equipment",
            "text": "<p>Each machine is stripped to bare metal, sanded, and repainted. Every unit receives new bearings, belts, and a new battery. Fitness Superstore is one of the very few US-based companies that offer fully remanufactured gym equipment, not just refurbished or serviced.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
