          "settings": {
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/c1ea2cb8cfaf5e02b93aa007fbe97bda.png",
            "title": "Refurbished equipment",
            "text": "<p>The equipment undergoes selective maintenance based on its condition. This process may include touch-up painting, belt replacements, and other necessary repairs. Most, if not all of our direct competitors offer refurbished equipment only.</p>",
